        <briefdescription>
<para>Generate a wasm section section header for S. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The header consists of<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>A one-byte section <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_calling_conv_1abdf8cf606905c10634e831390981b0ed" kindref="member">ID</ref> (aka the section type).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>The size of the section contents, encoded as ULEB128.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>If the section is a custom section (type 0) it also has a name, which is encoded as a length-prefixed string. The encoded section size <emphasis>includes</emphasis> this string. See <ulink url="https://webassembly.github.io/spec/core/binary/modules.html#sections">https://webassembly.github.io/spec/core/binary/modules.html#sections</ulink> Return the header and store the total size in SectionSize. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
